\ The compound splicer must decline when a row_region sits among the callee's
\ input operands: the unresolved-effect `call` collapses the stack to a row,
\ so splicing `h`'s `+` would reject it (NC.1) and fail the whole word where
\ the call path compiles it. A successful strict build is the regression
\ proof.

h: ( a b -- c ) [ + ] ;
k: ( q -- ) [ call 5 h drop ] ;

[ 7 ] k
